# plans/STRING_VALUE_SEMANTICS.md S1: the borrowed walk `for(&xs, s => ...)`
# binds `s : &String`, and a `self : &mut Self` write through it is E0908.
# `for(&mut xs, s => ...)` writes the elements. (Since the value flip, B8, a
# by-value `for(xs, s => ...)` moves each element out and a write to `s` is
# E0917 instead: a `for` binding is immutable, decision 47.)
stdout_keep_match=error(\[E[0-9]+\])?: .*|--> main\.yo:[0-9]+:[0-9]+
timeout=120
